                                "sense_id": "0bde739e-568b-3d54-a9f2-1ed7616ac4f6",
                                "text": "Niggas like talk like they getting this chetter\nGet caught, getting bust, do better!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "abb7bd34-c0f3-4847-a63f-64364ec39ad4",
                                "sense_id": "0bde739e-568b-3d54-a9f2-1ed7616ac4f6",
                                "text": "I was 15 with the longest shetty\nBack then I was called youngest shetty\nBack then your favourite rapper on telly\nWas at home just watchin telly"
